    "v_63829a063cf7908d_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 364.368005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道，中国大地上冬天最暖和的小城究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？有人说是三亚东方夏威夷。有人说是海口，椰城真正要是真信了，那就被忽悠了。三亚和海口确实暖和，可他们一个地级市，一个省会人，多价高商业化，真正适合咱们退休以后慢慢住。慢慢过冬的是那些藏库藏在山间海边，物价便宜、阳光管够的小城。今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国冬天最暖的十座小城。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。云南弥勒在云南红河洲这地方最绝的是一座被阳光偏爱的滇南暖城弥勒年均气温十八点八摄氏度，冬季平均最高气温在十七点七摄氏度到二十点九摄氏度之间。入冬以来，平均二十二摄氏度的气温，让老年人可以尽情在户外散步。赏景。弥勒最出名的是温泉湖泉生态园周边及梅花温泉社区的民宿酒店预订量持续攀升。进入冬季以来，入住率基本是满房状态。一位吉林游客说的好，东北已经零下十五六度。这里气温太适合退休养老了。这座小城节奏慢，物价低，特别适合退休的老两口，安安静静住上十天半个月，每天泡温泉晒太阳吃葡萄。第九名，云南建水在云南红河州这地方最绝的是一座活着的千年古城。建水冬季平均温度在十五到二十摄氏度，白天晒晒太阳，随便一站就是蓝天白云。建水最出名的是他的烟火气。建水双龙桥建水文庙朱家花园全是几百年的老建筑。最绝的是建水的美食，汽锅鸡、烧豆腐、草芽米线，每一道都带着古城的历史和温度。您坐在古城的老街上吃一碗草芽米线，看夕阳，照在朝阳楼上那种舒服劲儿，别的地方找不着第八名。云南芒氏在云南德宏州这地方最绝的是他有一个特别好听的名字，傣语叫猛幻，意思是黎明之城。芒氏位于北纬二十四度，全球黄金气候带，年平均气温十九点六摄氏度。冬季白天多数在二十摄氏度以上，夜间气温很少，低于十摄氏度。芒氏最绝的是他的绿化街道，两旁种的全是菠萝蜜、芒果、龙眼棕榈树，走在街上抬头就是果子。这座小城空气质量优良率常年保持在百分之九十九以上，森林覆盖率接近百分之七十。一位武汉游客说，冬天也能穿短袖第七名。云南沅江在云南玉溪这地方最绝的是一座被太阳厚爱的干热。河谷小城援疆年均气温二十四点一摄氏度，就算是最冷的一月，平均气温也稳稳保持在十七摄氏度以上，终年无双，素有天然温室之称。援疆现在专门做吕居康养，全县可承载吕居的空间达一点四七万余间套，床位超二点二五万个，还开了圆圆食堂、自家人、食堂等主客共享食堂，融合各地饮食文化。吕居公寓负责人苏月龄已从卖房人变成大家长房车营地经营者苍少平则与诸多客人成了老朋友。外地人去了，慢慢就成了自家人。第六名，四川米易在四川攀枝花这地方最绝的是一个藏在北纬二十六度阳光黄金带上的小县城。闽疫冬季日均气温保持在十一摄氏度到二十五摄氏度之间，年日照时数达二千七百小时，空气质量优良率常年保持在百分之九十五以上。当川西高原被冰雪覆盖的时候，米邑还是暖洋洋的这座小城。最舒服的过法是找个农家乐住下来，白天晒太阳，吃鲜果，泡温泉，晚上在安宁河边散散步。米邑的琵琶芒果樱桃便宜到您不敢相信。从第十到第六，米勒有温泉和慢节奏见水，有古城和烧豆腐，忙市满街都是果树援江，把旅居客当自家人。米邑是阳光黄金带上的小县城，这五个还只是开胃菜。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个暖，有一座小城，跟三亚共享，同一片海，价格却温柔一半。有一座小城，冬天能穿开胃，却海鲜十块钱一打。还有一座小城，是中国唯一的热带半岛城市，他们是哪下集马上更新，您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 670,
      "text": "您知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 670,
      "end_ms": 6510,
      "text": "中国大地上冬天最暖和的小城究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6890,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "有人说是三亚东方夏威夷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10130,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "有人说是海口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11750,
      "end_ms": 14710,
      "text": "椰城真正要是真信了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14950,
      "end_ms": 16129,
      "text": "那就被忽悠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16850,
      "end_ms": 19070,
      "text": "三亚和海口确实暖和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19750,
      "end_ms": 21290,
      "text": "可他们一个地级市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21530,
      "end_ms": 22910,
      "text": "一个省会人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22970,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "多价高商业化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25290,
      "end_ms": 27690,
      "text": "真正适合咱们退休以后慢慢住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28030,
      "end_ms": 31480,
      "text": "慢慢过冬的是那些藏库藏在山间海边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31880,
      "end_ms": 34840,
      "text": "物价便宜、阳光管够的小城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 35320,
      "end_ms": 39860,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国冬天最暖的十座小城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40200,
      "end_ms": 40820,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41060,
      "end_ms": 41800,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41800,
      "end_ms": 44360,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 44600,
      "end_ms": 46920,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 47260,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "text": "云南弥勒在云南红河洲这地方最绝的是一座被阳光偏爱的滇南暖城弥勒年均气温十八点八摄氏度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59320,
      "end_ms": 65425,
      "text": "冬季平均最高气温在十七点七摄氏度到二十点九摄氏度之间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 66120,
      "end_ms": 66900,
      "text": "入冬以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 66900,
      "end_ms": 69490,
      "text": "平均二十二摄氏度的气温，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 69610,
      "end_ms": 72570,
      "text": "让老年人可以尽情在户外散步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 72630,
      "end_ms": 73110,
      "text": "赏景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73170,
      "end_ms": 83485,
      "text": "弥勒最出名的是温泉湖泉生态园周边及梅花温泉社区的民宿酒店预订量持续攀升。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 83960,
      "end_ms": 85180,
      "text": "进入冬季以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 85260,
      "end_ms": 87625,
      "text": "入住率基本是满房状态。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 88170,
      "end_ms": 89815,
      "text": "一位吉林游客说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 90430,
      "end_ms": 92635,
      "text": "东北已经零下十五六度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 93530,
      "end_ms": 96085,
      "text": "这里气温太适合退休养老了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 96280,
      "end_ms": 98085,
      "text": "这座小城节奏慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 98360,
      "end_ms": 99095,
      "text": "物价低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 99730,
      "end_ms": 101665,
      "text": "特别适合退休的老两口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 102140,
      "end_ms": 104765,
      "text": "安安静静住上十天半个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 105300,
      "end_ms": 108955,
      "text": "每天泡温泉晒太阳吃葡萄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 109380,
      "end_ms": 110000,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 110120,
      "end_ms": 117185,
      "text": "云南建水在云南红河州这地方最绝的是一座活着的千年古城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 117810,
      "end_ms": 122495,
      "text": "建水冬季平均温度在十五到二十摄氏度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 123220,
      "end_ms": 124355,
      "text": "白天晒晒太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 124860,
      "end_ms": 127355,
      "text": "随便一站就是蓝天白云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 128150,
      "end_ms": 131455,
      "text": "建水最出名的是他的烟火气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 131910,
      "end_ms": 139075,
      "text": "建水双龙桥建水文庙朱家花园全是几百年的老建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 139490,
      "end_ms": 141795,
      "text": "最绝的是建水的美食，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 142340,
      "end_ms": 144985,
      "text": "汽锅鸡、烧豆腐、草芽米线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 145420,
      "end_ms": 148255,
      "text": "每一道都带着古城的历史和温度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 148870,
      "end_ms": 152245,
      "text": "您坐在古城的老街上吃一碗草芽米线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 152670,
      "end_ms": 153330,
      "text": "看夕阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 153330,
      "end_ms": 155795,
      "text": "照在朝阳楼上那种舒服劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 156000,
      "end_ms": 157755,
      "text": "别的地方找不着第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 158000,
      "end_ms": 165415,
      "text": "云南芒氏在云南德宏州这地方最绝的是他有一个特别好听的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 165860,
      "end_ms": 167565,
      "text": "傣语叫猛幻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 168150,
      "end_ms": 169885,
      "text": "意思是黎明之城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 170710,
      "end_ms": 172750,
      "text": "芒氏位于北纬二十四度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 172750,
      "end_ms": 174414,
      "text": "全球黄金气候带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 174880,
      "end_ms": 177835,
      "text": "年平均气温十九点六摄氏度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 178450,
      "end_ms": 180995,
      "text": "冬季白天多数在二十摄氏度以上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 181760,
      "end_ms": 183400,
      "text": "夜间气温很少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 183400,
      "end_ms": 184585,
      "text": "低于十摄氏度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 185160,
      "end_ms": 187740,
      "text": "芒氏最绝的是他的绿化街道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 187740,
      "end_ms": 192245,
      "text": "两旁种的全是菠萝蜜、芒果、龙眼棕榈树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 193010,
      "end_ms": 195725,
      "text": "走在街上抬头就是果子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 196530,
      "end_ms": 201645,
      "text": "这座小城空气质量优良率常年保持在百分之九十九以上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 202160,
      "end_ms": 204745,
      "text": "森林覆盖率接近百分之七十。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 205440,
      "end_ms": 206745,
      "text": "一位武汉游客说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 207100,
      "end_ms": 210855,
      "text": "冬天也能穿短袖第七名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 211270,
      "end_ms": 219630,
      "text": "云南沅江在云南玉溪这地方最绝的是一座被太阳厚爱的干热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 224665,
      "text": "河谷小城援疆年均气温二十四点一摄氏度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 225150,
      "end_ms": 227290,
      "text": "就算是最冷的一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 227370,
      "end_ms": 231235,
      "text": "平均气温也稳稳保持在十七摄氏度以上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 232000,
      "end_ms": 233065,
      "text": "终年无双，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 233470,
      "end_ms": 235425,
      "text": "素有天然温室之称。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 236430,
      "end_ms": 238745,
      "text": "援疆现在专门做吕居康养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 239360,
      "end_ms": 243305,
      "text": "全县可承载吕居的空间达一点四七万余间套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 243800,
      "end_ms": 245985,
      "text": "床位超二点二五万个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 246580,
      "end_ms": 251025,
      "text": "还开了圆圆食堂、自家人、食堂等主客共享食堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 251650,
      "end_ms": 253575,
      "text": "融合各地饮食文化。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 254180,
      "end_ms": 263735,
      "text": "吕居公寓负责人苏月龄已从卖房人变成大家长房车营地经营者苍少平则与诸多客人成了老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 263960,
      "end_ms": 264900,
      "text": "外地人去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 265020,
      "end_ms": 266415,
      "text": "慢慢就成了自家人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 266950,
      "end_ms": 267645,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 268030,
      "end_ms": 277835,
      "text": "四川米易在四川攀枝花这地方最绝的是一个藏在北纬二十六度阳光黄金带上的小县城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 278520,
      "end_ms": 283005,
      "text": "闽疫冬季日均气温保持在十一摄氏度到二十五摄氏度之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 283510,
      "end_ms": 286935,
      "text": "年日照时数达二千七百小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 287790,
      "end_ms": 292245,
      "text": "空气质量优良率常年保持在百分之九十五以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 292860,
      "end_ms": 295520,
      "text": "当川西高原被冰雪覆盖的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 295840,
      "end_ms": 298760,
      "text": "米邑还是暖洋洋的这座小城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 298880,
      "end_ms": 302100,
      "text": "最舒服的过法是找个农家乐住下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 302780,
      "end_ms": 304080,
      "text": "白天晒太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 304560,
      "end_ms": 305340,
      "text": "吃鲜果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 305560,
      "end_ms": 306340,
      "text": "泡温泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 306960,
      "end_ms": 309340,
      "text": "晚上在安宁河边散散步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 310180,
      "end_ms": 315440,
      "text": "米邑的琵琶芒果樱桃便宜到您不敢相信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 315920,
      "end_ms": 317540,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 318500,
      "end_ms": 322365,
      "text": "米勒有温泉和慢节奏见水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 322670,
      "end_ms": 324510,
      "text": "有古城和烧豆腐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 325390,
      "end_ms": 329130,
      "text": "忙市满街都是果树援江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 329130,
      "end_ms": 330850,
      "text": "把旅居客当自家人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 331850,
      "end_ms": 334970,
      "text": "米邑是阳光黄金带上的小县城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 335510,
      "end_ms": 337850,
      "text": "这五个还只是开胃菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 338710,
      "end_ms": 340410,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 340830,
      "end_ms": 341970,
      "text": "一个比一个暖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 342310,
      "end_ms": 343470,
      "text": "有一座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 343710,
      "end_ms": 344750,
      "text": "跟三亚共享，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 344750,
      "end_ms": 345690,
      "text": "同一片海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 345690,
      "end_ms": 348030,
      "text": "价格却温柔一半。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 348030,
      "end_ms": 349770,
      "text": "有一座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 349770,
      "end_ms": 351850,
      "text": "冬天能穿开胃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 351850,
      "end_ms": 353965,
      "text": "却海鲜十块钱一打。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 354600,
      "end_ms": 355765,
      "text": "还有一座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 356160,
      "end_ms": 358785,
      "text": "是中国唯一的热带半岛城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 359290,
      "end_ms": 361215,
      "text": "他们是哪下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 361490,
      "end_ms": 363050,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_63829a063cf7908d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 363050,
      "end_ms": 364255,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
